     1446   ON RETURN OF br-cds IN FRAME d-prod-cds
     1447   DO:
     1448   apply "choose" to b-mark in frame d-prod-cds.
     1449   END.
     1450   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF br-cds IN FRAME d-prod-cds
     1451   DO:
     1452   if available prod-cds then
     1453     disp prod-cds.b-str with frame d-prod-cds.
     1454   END.
     1455   define variable vss-include-info12 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1456   on INS of frame d-prod-cds anywhere do:
